4. **Stale state in handleEventContinue** — Was calling `advanceEvent()` directly after `setRun`. Now uses useEffect-driven advance.
5. **Event index management** — Properly increment eventIdx in the right callbacks.

Also added a favicon. Build succeeds, pushed to origin.
