- **Option gating**: Intel-locked dialogue options now properly check collected items by `intel_id` or `unlocks_option_tag`
- **UI**: Intel count shown in status bar, amber-styled "INTEL FOUND" panel on discovery events with name, description, narrator line, and flavor text

